sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cam as Camera (USB/RTSP)
    participant VT as VideoThread
    participant FD as FaceDetectionService
    participant FR as FaceRecognitionService
    participant GM as GalleryManager
    participant AS as AlertService
    participant DB as SQLite DB
    participant UI as DashboardView
    participant TG as TelegramService

    Cam->>VT: Grab frame (720p @ 30fps)
    VT->>FD: detect(frame)
    FD-->>VT: BoundingBox + Landmarks + Quality OK
    VT->>FR: extract_embedding(aligned_crop)
    FR-->>VT: 128-D Vector
    VT->>GM: match_face(query_vector, threshold=0.58)
    GM-->>VT: Match Found (Target #42, Sim: 0.84)
    VT->>AS: process_match(target_id=42, sim=0.84, crop)
    Note over AS: Check Multi-Frame Gate<br/>(N >= 2 within 5s window)
    AS->>AS: Confirm Match (Frame 2 of 2)
    AS->>DB: Save DetectionLog & Snapshot on disk
    AS->>UI: emit alert_created(AlertEvent)
    UI->>UI: Render AlertCard & Trigger Audio Chime
    AS->>TG: async send_alert_photo(snapshot, metadata)
    TG-->>AS: HTTP 200 OK
